# One word per line. A word here is never collapsed by the stutter-cleanup
# regex, comma or not - use it for words you personally double on purpose
# for emphasis ("this is very, very good"), and for words English doubles
# legitimately, which the regex can't tell from a stutter: "now that that's
# done", "the script I had had written".
#
# Copy this file to emphasis_words.txt and fill it in with your own words.
# emphasis_words.txt is gitignored on purpose, same as corrections.txt.
very
really
no
that
had
